WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:03.023
Roxy hurried over to Terrell.

2
00:00:03.024 --> 00:00:05.227
"I've got to go," she whispered.

3
00:00:05.228 --> 00:00:09.620
"A vandal sprayed paint inside the Metro City Art Museum."

4
00:00:09.621 --> 00:00:12.266
"Good luck," Terrell whispered.

5
00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:16.081
Mr. Barns was still helping another student.

6
00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.415
"I'll be right back, Mr. Barns," Roxy called.

7
00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:22.123
"I need to clean my brush."

8
00:00:22.124 --> 00:00:26.953
"Wait, Roxy!" the teacher called. "You can do that here."

9
00:00:26.954 --> 00:00:30.952
But Roxy was already gone.

10
00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:35.193
*** Roxy arrived at the art

11
00:00:35.194 --> 00:00:37.778
museum. She found Detective Smith

12
00:00:37.779 --> 00:00:40.767
inside. He was talking to a security guard and taking

13
00:00:40.768 --> 00:00:43.165
notes. The guard was covered in

14
00:00:43.166 --> 00:00:45.712
paint. Roxy saw paint splatters on the

15
00:00:45.713 --> 00:00:48.661
walls. But the paintings all looked

16
00:00:48.662 --> 00:00:52.118
okay. "Hi, Detective!" Roxy

17
00:00:52.119 --> 00:00:55.945
smiled. "Did your pen explode on this security

18
00:00:55.946 --> 00:01:04.077
guard?" Detective Smith groaned. "No, Rocket Girl. My pen did not

19
00:01:04.078 --> 00:01:08.613
explode." The guard frowned at Roxy. "This isn't funny, Rocket

20
00:01:08.614 --> 00:01:12.129
Girl. I might need a whole new

21
00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.157
uniform!" Roxy held up her hands. "Okay,

22
00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:17.326
okay. I won't make any more

23
00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:19.473
jokes. Did you get a look at the

24
00:01:19.474 --> 00:01:21.472
vandal?" The security guard shook her

25
00:01:21.473 --> 00:01:23.787
head. "It was too dark to see

26
00:01:23.788 --> 00:01:27.223
much. But the vandal had lots of

27
00:01:27.224 --> 00:01:32.051
arms." Detective Smith looked confused. "Lots of

28
00:01:32.052 --> 00:01:37.101
arms?" "Yes. Like an octopus." The guard looked

29
00:01:37.102 --> 00:01:40.799
scared. "That's odd," Detective Smith said.

30
00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.302
Roxy went over to one of the paint splatters.

31
00:01:44.303 --> 00:01:46.349
She looked closely at it.

32
00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:49.389
The detective and the guard walked over.

33
00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:53.717
"The vandal must really hate art," Detective Smith said.

34
00:01:53.718 --> 00:01:57.360
"I don't think so, Detective," Roxy said.

35
00:01:57.361 --> 00:02:00.215
"The vandal sprayed paint on all the walls.

36
00:02:00.216 --> 00:02:04.502
But look around—none of the paintings were damaged."

37
00:02:04.503 --> 00:02:08.177
"Huh," the guard said. "You're right."

38
00:02:08.178 --> 00:02:13.366
Roxy tilted her head. "These splatters actually look pretty cool."

39
00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:15.322
Detective Smith tapped his chin.

40
00:02:15.323 --> 00:02:17.494
"Maybe the vandal is an artist."

41
00:02:17.495 --> 00:02:21.618
"Look!" The security guard pointed to the bottom of a splatter.

42
00:02:21.619 --> 00:02:25.400
"Somebody signed the wall!"

43
00:02:25.401 --> 00:02:30.091
Roxy looked at the wall. "Kid Squid" was written there.

44
00:02:30.092 --> 00:02:34.421
"Have you ever heard of Kid Squid, Detective?" Roxy asked.

45
00:02:34.422 --> 00:02:39.981
Detective Smith shook his head. Just then his phone rang.

46
00:02:39.982 --> 00:02:44.550
"Hello? Oh no! We're on our way!"

47
00:02:44.551 --> 00:02:46.570
Detective Smith turned to Roxy.

48
00:02:46.571 --> 00:02:50.508
"The vandal is in an art gallery down the street."

49
00:02:50.509 --> 00:02:53.514
Roxy and Detective Smith hurried down the street.

50
00:02:53.515 --> 00:02:56.417
People stood outside the art gallery.

51
00:02:56.418 --> 00:02:59.753
"There's a squid in my art gallery!" the owner said.

52
00:02:59.754 --> 00:03:02.424
A man wiped paint from his face.

53
00:03:02.425 --> 00:03:05.605
"The squid is making a huge mess inside!"

54
00:03:05.606 --> 00:03:08.473
Detective Smith threw open the gallery's door.

55
00:03:08.474 --> 00:03:14.859
Splat! He stumbled backward, covered in blue paint!

